  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable activates luck path killer move Nothing is Certain Except Success. Golden light flickers on his body, rises above his head, and turns into an amber jade sphere. Even Fang Yuan and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable feel their hearts palpitate. He gives a low shout and fiercely strikes the amber jade sphere with his head. The sphere shoots toward Fang Yuan.",
