    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan sees that Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s surging luck has mostly dissipated and nearly gone back to its original state, and knows how terrifying the move is. He cannot immediately decipher its profundities, so he does not take it head-on and dodges behind Spectral Soul Demon Venerable. Later the luck path killer move that looks like an amber egg intrudes inside the starry chessboard during a stalemate.",
